12.94 emacsvox-google
=====================

There are a number of search tools that can be implemented on the Google
search page -- in a JS-powered browser, these show up as the Google
tool-belt.  This module implements a minor mode for use in Google result
pages that enables these tools via single keyboard commands.  Originally
all options were available as tbs=p:v Now, some specialized searches,
e.g.  blog search are tbm=

12.94.1 Emacsvox-Google Commands
--------------------------------

12.94.1.1 emacsvox-google-extract-from-cache
............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-extract-from-cache

     Extract current  page from the Google cache.

12.94.1.2 emacsvox-google-knowledge-search
..........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-knowledge-search (query &optional limit)

     Perform a Google Knowledge Graph search.
     Optional interactive prefix arg ‘limit’ prompts for number of
     results, default is 1.

     (fn QUERY &optional LIMIT)

12.94.1.3 emacsvox-google-on-this-site
......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-on-this-site

     Perform a google search restricted to the current WWW site.

12.94.1.4 emacsvox-google-open-link
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-open-link

     Open Google link under point.

12.94.1.5 emacsvox-google-search-after
......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-search-after

     Google from calendar -- add after:date-at-point.

12.94.1.6 emacsvox-google-search-before
.......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-search-before

     Google from calendar -- add before:date-at-point.

12.94.1.7 emacsvox-google-show-toolbelt
.......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-show-toolbelt

     Reload search page with toolbelt showing.

12.94.1.8 emacsvox-google-sign-in
.................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-sign-in

     Sign in to Google.

12.94.1.9 emacsvox-google-sign-out
..................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-sign-out

     Sign out to Google.

12.94.1.10 emacsvox-google-similar-to-this-page
...............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-similar-to-this-page (url)

     Ask Google to find documents similar to this one.

     (fn URL)

12.94.1.11 emacsvox-google-toolbelt-change
..........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-toolbelt-change

     Command to change values in the toolbelt and execute the query.

12.94.1.12 emacsvox-google-tts-line
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-google-tts-line (&optional lang)
     ‘C-. g l’
     ‘C-x @ s g l’

     TTS line using network TTS.
     Use default voice for buffer.

     (fn &optional LANG)

