................................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-mines-jump-to-uncovered-cell (from-beginning)

     Jump to next uncovered cell. With interactive prefix-arg, jump
     to beginning of board before searching.

     (fn FROM-BEGINNING)

12.126.1.5 emacsvox-mines-speak-board
.....................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-mines-speak-board

