12.167 emacsvox-setup
=====================

Entry point for Emacsvox.  The simplest and most basic way to start
emacsvox is: emacs -q -l <emacsvox-dir>/lisp/emacsvox-setup.el The above
starts a vanilla Emacs with just Emacsvox loaded.  Once the above has
been verified to work, You can add (load-library "emacsvox-setup") To
your .emacs file.  See tvr/emacs-startup.el in the Emacsvox Git
repository for my setup.


