     Prompt for a table cell coordinates and jump to it.

     (fn ROW COLUMN)

12.182.1.7 emacsvox-table-goto-bottom
.....................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-goto-bottom
     ‘C-e C-t B’
     ‘C-e C-t M->’

     Goes to the bottom of the current column.

12.182.1.8 emacsvox-table-goto-left
...................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-goto-left
     ‘C-e C-t A’
     ‘C-e C-t <’

     Goes to the left of the current row.

12.182.1.9 emacsvox-table-goto-right
....................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-table-goto-right
     ‘C-e C-t E’
     ‘C-e C-t >’

