..........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-vdiff-speak-other-line

     Speak corresponding line from other buffer.

12.196.1.3 emacsvox-vdiff-speak-this-hunk
.........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-vdiff-speak-this-hunk

     Speak VDiff hunk under point.


