12.204 emacsvox-which-key
=========================

Which-Key displays available keybindings in a popup after pressing a
prefix key.  This module speech-enables Which-Key to provide auditory
feedback for available bindings, supporting navigation through pages and
speaking the current binding options.

12.204.1 Emacsvox-Which-Key Commands
------------------------------------

