12.207 emacsvox-wizards
=======================

Contains various wizards for the Emacsvox desktop.

12.207.1 Emacsvox-Wizards Commands
----------------------------------

12.207.1.1 emacsvox-brightness-alert-toggle
...........................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-brightness-alert-toggle

     Toggle brightness alert.

12.207.1.2 emacsvox-brightness-autoblack-toggle
...............................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-brightness-autoblack-toggle

     Toggle brightness autoblack.

12.207.1.3 emacsvox-copy-current-file
.....................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-copy-current-file
     ‘C-e M-c’

     Copy file visited in current buffer to new location.
     Prompts for the new location and preserves modification time
       when copying.  If location is a directory, the file is copied
       to that directory under its current name ; if location names
       a file in an existing directory, the specified name is
       used.  Asks for confirmation if the copy will result in an
       existing file being overwritten.

12.207.1.4 emacsvox-customize
.............................

 -- Command: emacsvox-customize
     ‘C-e C’

     Customize Emacsvox.

12.207.1.5 emacsvox-describe-emacsvox
.....................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-describe-emacsvox
     ‘C-h C-e’
     ‘<f1> C-e’
     ‘<help> C-e’

     Give a brief overview of emacsvox.

12.207.1.6 emacsvox-kill-buffer-quietly
.......................................

 -- Command: emacsvox-kill-buffer-quietly
     ‘C-e C-t Q’

     Kill current buffer without  confirmation.

